{"id":51710,"date":"2026-06-19T05:49:57","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T04:49:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/axtrail-series-4-fajao\/"},"modified":"2026-09-19T19:53:02","modified_gmt":"2026-09-19T18:53:02","slug":"axtrail-series-4-fajao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/axtrail-series-4-fajao\/","title":{"rendered":"AXtrail Series #4 Faj\u00e3o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">AXtrail Series #4 Faj\u00e3o 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>AXtrail Series #4 Faj\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na pitoresca <strong>Aldeia do Xisto de Faj\u00e3o<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Pampilhosa da Serra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o emblem\u00e1tica do <strong>Clube de Praticantes Mondego Ultra Trail<\/strong> em parceria com a rede <strong>Aldeias do Xisto<\/strong> e a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Pampilhosa da Serra.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A etapa de encerramento do circuito apresenta o <strong>AXtrail Series #4 de 24 km (+1.500m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/stro